 "remarks": "Beautiful and spacious 3 bedroom, 2 bath ranch style with vaulted ceilings in pristine condition. Hardwood floors throughout. A lovely eat-in-kitchen with stainless steel appliances. Huge Master bedroom with walk-in closet, marble Jacuzzi and lovely deck. Only 2nd floor is for rent. Private Entrance and porch. Washer and dryer in unit. Live-in super who takes care of tenants needs in a expeditious manner. Pristine location, close to the Merritt and short drive to downtown Stamford. Close to Trader Joe's, CVS, Delis, Lord and Taylor, schools, bus stops and so much more. Two parking spaces in the private parking lot will be provided. Pets allowed at super's discretion. Features: Ceiling Fan, Deck, Flooring: Hardwood, Patio Storage and Vaulted Ceiling. Additional Features Heating system: Forced Air. Appliances Included: Dishwasher, Dryer, Freezer, Microwave, Refrigerator & Washer. Rooms Types: Dining room, Master bath and Walk-in closet.",
